{"id":"recepc_a_o","lemma":"recepção","pos":"noun","rank":2358,"glosses":["reception (act of receiving)","reception, front desk (the desk of a hotel, office etc. where guests are received)"],"gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"recepções"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/96/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Wiktionairy-recep%C3%A7%C3%A3o.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu estava na recepção.","en":"I was at the reception.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535158","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Deixei a chave na recepção.","en":"I left the key at the reception desk.","words":[{"g":"to leave","l":"deixar"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"key"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"Houve uma grande recepção após o casamento.","en":"There was a big reception after the wedding.","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"large"},null,{"g":"after"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"wedding"}]},{"text":"Tivemos uma calorosa recepção.","en":"We received a warm welcome.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/859193","words":[{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"enthusiastic","l":"caloroso"},null]},{"text":"Na recepção, ele me apresentou sua família.","en":"He introduced me to his relatives at the reception.","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to introduce","l":"apresentar"},{"g":"his","l":"seu"},{"g":"family"}]}]}